# Cloudflare Pages: static assets (JS bundles, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, og-image.png, ...) are matched
# before these rules run. The app's own pretty-URL routes have no static file of their own (web.output:
# "single", one index.html) so they need an explicit rewrite; a path that matches none of them is real
# garbage, not a route this app knows, so it gets a real 404 instead of the SPA shell at 200
# (plan/CRITIQUE.md pass 13).
/browse/*    /index.html  200
/book/*      /index.html  200
/credits     /index.html  200
/downloads   /index.html  200
/import      /index.html  200
/licenses    /index.html  200
/privacy     /index.html  200
/settings    /index.html  200
/soundtrack  /index.html  200
/*           /404.html    404
